# Read by `npm run dev` (tsx --env-file-if-exists=.env) and, once, by
# `npx nylorun start` when it links the project, which seeds the Tenant's model
# provider from these into the Runtime vault (never back into this file):
# MODEL_PROVIDER=...
# MODEL=...
# MODEL_PROVIDER_API_KEY=...
# MODEL_PROVIDER_BASE_URL=... # only for a custom provider
# PORT=8787
# NYLORUN_IMPLEMENTATION_VERSION=dev
